{"id":"580293f302105c8f","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-dualcomparable.md","title":"Dual-comparable function","display":"df-dualcomparable — Dual-comparable function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-dualcomparable","aliases":["27-df-dualcomparable"],"display":"df-dualcomparable — Dual-comparable function","depends_on":["[[27-df-dual]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-dualcomparable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-dualcomparable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dualcomparable — Dual-comparable function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b491e41297256b44\" href=\"?note=b491e41297256b44\" title=\"27-df-dual\">27-df-dual</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dual}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Dual}_n\\)</span> is defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b491e41297256b44\" href=\"?note=b491e41297256b44\" title=\"27-df-dual\">27-df-dual</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DualComparable}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n:(\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;f(a)\\le\\mathrm{Dual}_n(f)(a))\\lor(\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\mathrm{Dual}_n(f)(a)\\le f(a))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DualComparable}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n:(\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;f(a)\\le\\mathrm{Dual}_n(f)(a))\\lor(\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\mathrm{Dual}_n(f)(a)\\le f(a))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §4.1.3, Definition 4.2，印刷页 170，PDF 第 194 页（从 1 计数）。 等号情形已包含 self-dual，不需第三个析取。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-dual","status":"resolved","id":"b491e41297256b44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dual]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dual","status":"resolved","id":"b491e41297256b44","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-dual]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dual}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DualComparable}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n:(\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;f(a)\\le\\mathrm{Dual}_n(f)(a))\\lor(\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\mathrm{Dual}_n(f)(a)\\le f(a))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":901,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-206","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-dualcomparable|df-dualcomparable — Dual-comparable function]]"}],"outgoing":["b491e41297256b44","5d10aed668d85817"]}